759</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"427\">\n<ul>\n<li>UPSSSC PET 2025 Score Card.</li>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Agriculture B.Sc Agriculture / Horticulture / Home Science / Community Science / Forestry OR&nbsp; B.E / B.Tech Engineering Degree in Agriculture</li>\n<li>More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSSSC Technical Assistant Group C Exam 2026 :&nbsp; </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Category Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"141\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>General (UR)</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EWS</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>OBC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"101\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>ST</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\n<p align=\"center\">Technical Assistant Group C Advt No 06-Exam/2026</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"141\">1692</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\">275</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"97\">573</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"101\">213</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">06</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">2759</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill : UPSSSC UP Technical Assistant Group C Recruitment Online Form 2026 </b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>There are 02 types to apply online for UPSSSC UP Technical Assistant Group C (AGTA) Recruitment Advt No. 06-Exam/2026 Recruitment 2026.</b></li>\n<li><b>First:</b> In this, the candidate will have to login with his personal information, the information that has to be given is: PET Registration Number, Date of Birth, Gender, Domicile and Category.</li>\n<li><b>Second :</b> In this, the candidate will have to login through his OTP, the information that has to be given is: PET 2025 Registration Number and OTP Password.</li>\n<li>After login, the complete information of the candidate, his photo and signature will also be visible, the candidate will have to fill the information related to the post he is asking for and the application fee: Rs.25/- will have to be paid.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UPSSSC Advt No : <b>06-Exam/2026 </b>Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color